                                        "entry_id": "3c90271d-bb63-38b3-90a6-4c2dad2753ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a patriotic manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5ec1ecd-585e-446a-939c-f4dde0fada4e",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7cc5f-a0dc-370d-942f-c49e10e4d9be",
                                                "text": "The obsessive subject of our sterile confrontation between the two PCs ― the politically and the patriotically correct ― is clumsily labeled \"multiculturalism\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1849523-c491-466b-9582-621d8d00ecb2",
                                                "sense_id": "24c7cc5f-a0dc-370d-942f-c49e10e4d9be",
                                                "text": "In fifteen years, you can bring up thy country And make your people work in a full symmetry With their cultureful socialist revolutionary And learn how to read, write and speak freely Know that their ideas are costlier than jewellery And work for their motherland patriotically"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
